  Becoming.RegimeMargin.Adjusted.Rises A →
    Becoming.RegimeMargin.Adjusted.Band A H hi →
      Becoming.RegimeMargin.Adjusted.Below p q →
        q.fst ≤ hi →
          q.snd ≤ hi → Becoming.RegimeMargin.Adjusted.RestsBelow A H q → Becoming.RegimeMargin.Adjusted.RestsBelow A H p
